[211.728716, "o", "> "]
[211.728764, "o", "## Timeline of Events (UTC)"]
[211.730277, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> 1. 2026-08-15 00:53:24 - 00:54:52: External SSH brute-force attack against root user initiated from attacker origin IP `/disk/var/log/secure:141`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> 2. 2026-08-15 00:54:55: Attacker successfully authenticates as root via SSH password brute force `/disk/var/log/secure:178`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> 3. 2026-08-15 00:55 - 01:29: Attacker conducts post-exploitation activity:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    - Dropped and executed Monero cryptominer binary at `/tmp/.X11-unix/.xorg` (`/disk/tmp/.X11-unix/.xorg`, `/sas/alerts.json`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    - Installed cron persistence in `/var/spool/cron/root` (`/disk/var/spool/cron/root:5`, `/sas/alerts.json`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    - Installed shell-init persistence in `/root/.bashrc` (`/disk/root/.bashrc:2`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    - Installed systemd service persistence at `/etc/systemd/system/system-update-helper.service` (`/disk/etc/systemd/system/system-update-helper.service`, `/sas/alerts.json`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    - Planted NOPASSWD sudo backdoor in `/etc/sudoers.d/devops` (`/disk/etc/sudoers.d/devops:3`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    - Cleared authentication logs causing log gap between 00:54:55 and 01:29:12 (`/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin`, `/disk/var/log/secure:178`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[211.730297, "o", "   - Executed hydra brute-force tool against internal targets from devops user account context (`/disk/home/devops/.bash_history:6`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[211.730516, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[211.730533, "o", "4. 2026-08-15 03:20: Incident detected and intake logged by SOC (`/sas/handoff/intake.pdf`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ## Investigative Checklist"]
